  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Owir Jehu ruodh Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha janabi noluongo achiel kuom jonabi mowachone niya, \"Ngʼwan lawi e nungoni, kendo ikaw morni idhigo e piny Ramoth Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ichopo kanyo, to imany Jehu wuod Jehoshafat, ma wuod Nimshi. Dhi ire igole oko e kind ji kendo itere nyaka ei ot kar kende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangʼ mano, kaw puga motingʼo mo iol e wiye kiwacho niya, 'Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye wacho: Asewali bedo ruodh Israel.' Bangʼ timo ma to iyaw dhoot; kendo ring piyo, kik ideki!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka wuowi matin ma janabi nodhi Ramoth Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane ochopo noyudo ka jotend lweny obet kanyakla. Nowachone jatend lweny niya, \"An-gi wach moro madwaro wachoni.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nopenje niya, \"En ngʼa kuomwa ka midwaro losogo?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nodwoke niya, \"En mana in, jatend lweny.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu nochungʼ malo modhi kode ei ot. Bangʼ mano janabino noolo mo ewi Jehu kowachone niya, \"Ma e gima Jehova Nyasaye ma Nyasach Israel wacho: 'Asewali mondo ibed ruodh Israel ma gin jo-Jehova Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyaka itiek od Ahab ma ruodhi, kendo abiro chulo kuor nikech remb jotichna ma jonabi kendo nikech remb jotich Jehova Nyasaye mane ochwer gi Jezebel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiro tieko od Ahab duto. Abiro tieko chwo manie od Ahab e piny Israel bedni gin wasumbini kata joma ni thuolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abiro keto od Ahab chal gi od Jeroboam wuod Nebat kendo ochal kaka od Baasha wuod Ahija.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ne Jezebel guogi ema nocham ringre e puodho manie paw Jezreel kendo onge ngʼama noyike.' \" Bangʼ mano noyawo dhoot moringo odhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Jehu odok ir jotend lweny wetene achiel kuomgi nopenje niya, \"Bende weche duto beyo? To angʼo mane janekono obirone iri?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodwokogi niya, \"Ungʼeyo ngʼatno, to gi gik ma onyalo wacho.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negikwere niya, \"Mano en miriambo, wachnwa adier.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodwokogi niya, \"Ma e gima nonyisa: 'Ni Jehova Nyasaye owacho: Asewiri mondo ibed ruodh Israel.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negigolo lepgi piyo piyo ma gipedho ewi raidhi mondo Jehu owuothie. Eka negigoyo turumbete ka gigoyo koko niya, \"Jehu en ruoth!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu onego Joram kod Ahazia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehu wuod Jehoshafat ma wuod Nimshi nochano lingʼ-lingʼ mondo omonj Joram. (Koro Joram gi jo-Israel duto nosebedo kakedo mondo gisir Ramoth Gilead kuom monj moa kuom Hazael ruodh Aram,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ruoth Joram noduogo Jezreel mondo ochangi kuom adhonde mane oyudo kuom lweny mane ni e kinde gi Hazael ruodh jo-Aram). Jehu mowachone niya, \"Ka ma e kaka uparo, to kik iyie ngʼato angʼata wuogi e dala maduongʼ ka mondo odhi ohul wachni e piny Jezreel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka nodhi moidho gache mar lweny moringo odhi Jezreel nikech Joram ne ni kuno kendo Ahazia ruodh Juda bende noyudo ni kuno kaka wendone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jangʼicho mane ni ewi ohinga man Jezreel noneno jolweny Jehu kabiro, nogoyo koko niya, \"Aneno ka jolweny biro.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joram nokone niya, \"Or ngʼato gi faras mondo odhi openjgi ka gibiro e yor kwe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jariemb faras noringo moromo gi Jehu mowachone niya, \"Ruodha penjo kama: 'Bende ubiro e yor kwe?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodwoke niya, \"Kwe to obadhi angʼo? Luw bangʼa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jangʼicho nodwoko wach ni Joram ni, \"Jaote osechopo irgi, to ok ane koduogo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuom mano ruoth nooro jariemb faras mar ariyo. Kane ochopo irgi nowachonegi niya, \"Ruodha penjo kama: 'Bende ubiro e yor kwe?' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodwoke niya, \"Kwe to obadhi e angʼo? Luw bangʼa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jangʼicho noduogo wach ne Joram niya, \"Osechopo irgi, to ok ane koduogo. Jariemb gari cha chalo mana gi Jehu wuod Nimshi, kendo oriembo mana ka janeko.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joram nogolo chik niya, \"Ikna gacha.\" To kane giseikone gache, Joram ruodh Israel kod Ahazia ruodh Juda noriembo gechegi, ka ngʼato ka ngʼato ni e gache owuon mondo girom gi Jehu. Negiromo kode e puodho mane mar Naboth ja-Jezreel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Joram oneno Jehu nopenje niya, \"Ibiro e yor kwe koso?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 9:22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodwoke niya, \"Ere kaka kwe nyalo betie kapod Jezebel minu dhi nyime gi lamo nyiseche manono kod timo timbe jwok?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joram nolokore moa gi ngʼwech kokok ne Ahazia niya, \"Ja-andhoga Ahazia!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Jehu noywayo atungʼ modiro asere kendo ochwoyo kind ngʼede Joram. Asere nopowo dho chunye molwar piny oa ewi gache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu nowachone Bidkar jatend gechene mag lweny niya, \"Kawe ibole e puodho mane mar Naboth ja-Jezreel. Par kaka in kod an ne wariembo gechewa kanyachiel bangʼ Ahab ma wuon-gi kane Jehova Nyasaye okoro wachni kuome kama:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'Nyoro ne aneno remb Naboth gi remb yawuote kendo adiera abiro miyo gichul kuom chwero remo e puodho manie pap,' Jehova Nyasaye owacho. Kaweuru kendo ubole e puodhono kaluwore gi wach Jehova Nyasaye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Ahazia ruodh Juda oneno gima otimore noringo kotony gi yor Beth-Hagan. Jehu nolawe kakok niya, \"En bende negeuru!\" Ne gihinye ewi gache mar lweny koringo ochomo Gur man but Ibleam, to notony kodhi Megido kuma nothoe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jotichne nokawe gi gach lweny nyaka Jerusalem moike kod kwerene e bure mantiere e Dala Maduongʼ mar Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E higa mar apar gachiel mar Joram wuod Ahab, Ahazia nobedo ruoth e piny Juda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oneg Jezebel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Jehu odhi Jezreel, Jezebel nowinjo birone kanyo, mi obuko wangʼe kendo oloso wiye kongʼicho gie dirisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane Jehu odonjo e dhorangach nopenjo niya, \"Ibiro e yor kwe, in Zimri ma janek ruodheni?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nongʼiyo malo e dirisa mopenjo niya, \"En ngʼa ma jakora? En ngʼa?\" Eka ji ariyo kata adek mabwoch nongʼiye gi kwinyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu nowachonegi niya, \"Diruru dhakono piny!\" Omiyo negidire piny ma rembe moko okirore e kor ohinga ka farase nyone piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehu nodonjo e dalano mochiemo kendo ometho. Eka nowachonegi niya, \"Kawuru dhako mokwongʼno udhi uyiki, nimar ne en nyar ruoth.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kane gidhi yike onge gima negiyudo makmana hanga wiye, tiendene gi lwetene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negidok ma giwachone Jehu wachno, mane owacho niya, \"Ma e wach mane Jehova Nyasaye owacho kokadho kuom jatichne Elija ja-Tishbi: E puodho manie paw Jezreel guogi nokidh ringre Jezebel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ringre Jezebel nochal ka owuoyo moyar e pewe mag Jezreel, maonge ngʼama nyalo wacho ni ma Jezebel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
